OL,3,GNEWSAProposals to increase Guernsey
OL,4,Aincome tax return
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo proposals to avoid the introduction
OL,7,Fof a goods and services (GST) tax in
OL,8,FGuernsey, by increasing the rate of
OL,9,Fincome tax instead, have been put
OL,10,Fforward.
OL,12,FFour deputies want to increase the rate
OL,13,Fto 22%, instead of Policy and
OL,14,FResources' (P&R) tax reform package,
OL,15,Fwith one of the schemes time-limited
OL,16,Ffor two years.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
