OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F442A1790227610
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProposals to increase Guernsey
OL,4,Aincome tax return
OL,5,
OL,6,FP&R's package includes a 3% GST,
OL,7,Freduced income tax rates, higher income
OL,8,Ftax allowances, limits for social
OL,9,Fsecurity contributions, the
OL,10,Freintroduction of motor tax and higher
OL,11,Ftaxes for some businesses.
OL,13,FThe scheme to increase income tax rates
OL,14,Fcomes alongside about 30 new proposals,
OL,15,Fwhich could be debated next week as
OL,16,Fpart of discussions on the future of
OL,17,FGuernsey's tax system.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
